{
  "id": "2KI.19",
  "number": "19",
  "bookId": "2KI",
  "reference": "2 Kings 19",
  "verseCount": 37,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As soon as King Hezekiah heard their report, he tore his clothes in grief, put on sackcloth, and went to the Temple of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He sent Eliakim, the official in charge of the palace, Shebna, the court secretary, and the senior priests to the prophet Isaiah son of Amoz. They also were wearing sackcloth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is the message which he told them to give Isaiah: “Today is a day of suffering; we are being punished and are in disgrace. We are like a woman who is ready to give birth, but is too weak to do it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Assyrian emperor has sent his chief official to insult the living God. May the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God hear these insults and punish those who spoke them. So pray to God for those of our people who survive.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Isaiah received King Hezekiah's message, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he sent back this answer: “The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " tells you not to let the Assyrians frighten you with their claims that he cannot save you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will cause the emperor to hear a rumour that will make him go back to his own country, and the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will have him killed there.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Assyrian official learnt that the emperor had left Lachish and was fighting against the nearby city of Libnah; so he went there to consult him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Word reached the Assyrians that the Egyptian army, led by King Tirhakah of Ethiopia",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19.9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ethiopia",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": See Word List.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", was coming to attack them. When the emperor heard this, he sent a letter to King Hezekiah of Judah ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to say to him, “The god you are trusting in has told you that you will not fall into my hands, but don't let that deceive you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You have heard what an Assyrian emperor does to any country he decides to destroy. Do you think that you can escape? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My ancestors destroyed the cities of Gozan, Haran, and Rezeph, and killed the people of Betheden who lived in Telassar, and none of their gods could save them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Where are the kings of the cities of Hamath, Arpad, Sepharvaim, Hena, and Ivvah?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "King Hezekiah took the letter from the messengers and read it. Then he went to the Temple, placed the letter there in the presence of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 25.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and prayed, “O ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel, enthroned above the winged creatures, you alone are God, ruling all the kingdoms of the world. You created the earth and the sky. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", look at what is happening to us. Listen to all the things that Sennacherib is saying to insult you, the living God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We all know, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", that the emperors of Assyria have destroyed many nations, made their lands desolate, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and burnt up their gods — which were no gods at all, only images of wood and stone made by human hands. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " our God, rescue us from the Assyrians, so that all the nations of the world will know that only you, O ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", are God.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Isaiah sent a message telling King Hezekiah that in answer to the king's prayer ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had said, “The city of Jerusalem laughs at you, Sennacherib, and despises you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whom do you think you have been insulting and ridiculing? You have been disrespectful to me, the holy God of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You sent your messengers to boast to me that with all your chariots you had conquered the highest mountains of Lebanon. You boasted that there you cut down the tallest cedars and the finest cypress trees and that you reached the deepest parts of the forests. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You boasted that you dug wells and drank water in foreign lands and that the feet of your soldiers tramped the River Nile dry.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Have you never heard that I planned all this long ago? And now I have carried it out. I gave you the power to turn fortified cities into piles of rubble. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The people who lived there were powerless; they were frightened and stunned. They were like grass in a field or weeds growing on a roof when the hot east wind blasts them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.26"
